      "pos": 7,
      "text": "Some states require the prosecution to prove voluntariness beyond a reasonable doubt as a matter of state law.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7",
      "pos": 8,
      "text": "Courts assess voluntariness under a totality of the circumstances test.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
