      "text": "Courts test the competing accounts against objective corroboration such as booking logs, medical records, and time-stamped custody sheets.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10",
      "pos": 11,
      "text": "The defendant's account of what occurred during the interrogation was inaccurate in part.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
